{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_tiger_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_tiger_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "幹員間切磋指南",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tiger_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f1f78b32cde88beb32183778d43362290e09f5342f30e3ea459859e4ba18306a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 因陀罗"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "8:27 A. M. 天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦，訓練場"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備好了嗎？我來啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動手之前誰會打招呼？這太蠢了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘗嘗這一拳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這拳頭跟枕頭沒兩樣，軟綿綿的，凍了兩天的黑麵包都比這個硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......明明移動速度沒有我快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼就是打不到？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒用，完全沒用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰教你這麼打架的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸教我的......格鬥技巧......爸爸是很厲害的警察！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？張口閉口爸爸，你還是小孩子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要分心哦，我會找到機會的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，這一拳像點樣子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再來，再來再來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（躲、躲不開......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這攻擊......角度好刁鑽！這是什麼拳法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？拳法？老子打架靠的就不是什麼拳法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有功夫講話，倒是拿出點真本事啊！老子還想多流點汗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "越來越快了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太慢，還是太慢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啊，我的眼睛！差一點！好險！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（根本沒有還手的機會......肚子上又挨了一下......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒勁！太沒勁了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，我說你，你是看不起老子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我打你，我是認真的。你，看上去把式不錯，出手卻老是磨磨蹭蹭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，你聽好了，剛剛那一拳頭，你要衝著老子的鼻子來，鼻子，在這裡！看到沒？砰一下，血就飆出來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......啊哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸說過......我的拳頭，應該只讓敵人流血......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊好煩啊！嗡嗡嗡的都是廢話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一點都不痛快！打架，就只是打架而已，為什麼要想那麼多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這小子，倒是挺耐打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一般人挨了我好幾下，早就哭著喊著求饒了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我不會求饒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很厲害，但你也不能......小瞧我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲喲，這話不錯，有點意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看在你沒逃走的份上，我就痛痛快快地讓你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......擋下了我的拳頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼東西？鞭子？你，不錯嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜賓老師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傑克，你下去，讓Lancet-2臨時處理下身上的傷，然後去醫務室報到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是訓練......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上午的訓練課程允許你缺席。特殊情況，下不為例。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，你記住，哪怕是在羅德島，訓練場就是戰場，你眼前只有對手，沒有朋友。在敵人面前，你的溫柔全都是弱點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次再被揍成這樣，我就要考慮給你加課了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記住了，老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......因陀羅幹員，謝謝你今天陪我練習！下次我一定會表現更好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，沒勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你站住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，你也想跟我打架嗎？你的話，看起來很不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會陪你扮家家酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扮家家酒？你說打架是扮家家酒？喂，沒搞錯吧，你知道我是怎麼過來的嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......因陀羅幹員，你現在的行為在我看來非常幼稚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經不是學生，不需要我來安排課程。但我還是想給你一些建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，第一條——在你準備好之前，不要再踏入訓練場一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？憑什麼？那個小兔子跟我說，想打架的話，都可以來這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想把時間浪費在指出你這句話有多少錯誤上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，訓練場不是你發洩私人情緒的地方。幹員之間的切磋也並不以給對方造成永久性損傷為目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你想清楚了，你可以再過來。新人們很需要你的戰鬥經驗來提供實戰指導。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是現在，請你離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。一幫子只會嘴上吧啦吧啦的傢伙，一個比一個沒意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每天憋在這裡，沒有架打，實在難受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃的都是些什麼玩意兒，有肉有馬鈴薯就行了，搞那麼多花樣和調料幹什麼？嚼著厭煩，嘴巴都淡得長毛了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有這房間，冷冰冰的鐵板子，還這麼窄，這是人待的地方嗎？這是監牢吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（砰——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加油，你再花點力氣，就能給這牆開個洞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當是哪個無聊的傢伙，原來是最無聊的那個。摩根，你有本事就別站在外面，你進來給老子打一拳，讓老子爽一下啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不要進來，打我你是打不著，可誰知道你下回憋不住砸牆的時候拳頭長不長眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說了，我不像你，我很忙的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，你那些事，我還真懶得搞清楚，反正就是跑來跑去的總不見人影，和過去一個樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀呀，人家再忙也不會忘了你，我的小漢娜~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說你在訓練場大鬧了一通，然後被趕出來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你就是來笑話我的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，你這麼說，我可要傷心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說我關心你你不信，那就當成我替維娜來看看，你有沒有給她惹麻煩吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主子知道了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別緊張嘛，我沒去告狀啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是啊，我們現在在別人船上，你做的事情，哪一件不會落到她耳朵裡？你以為她是誰啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，這次是老子錯了還不行嗎！我自己去找主子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，別著急嘛。也來了好一陣了，羅德島的人怎麼樣，你我都很清楚吧？維娜處境不錯，我們都用不著過得太緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說得對，我承認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的人還不錯。不像過去遇到的那樣......要嘛太壞，要嘛太弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不代表我非要喜歡這種生活。哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘴上說著不喜歡，實際上還是不習慣吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......嘁，怎麼可能習慣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然之間，不用每天躲來躲去，不會好幾天找不到地方睡覺，也用不著睡著了還要擔心有敵人靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想還真有點懷念呢，那時候你哪怕正睡著，聽到些響動就要睜一下眼，還會對著空氣揮好幾下拳頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是誰非要偷偷靠過來的？沒給你揍出黑眼圈，算老子手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不光能好好睡覺了，這地方還總有熱的東西可以吃，也用不著害怕吃著吃著坐在對面的人就要掏傢伙來偷襲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開倫蒂尼姆這麼久，一路上哪裡有過這種日子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一、二、三......我已經整整十四天沒有見過血，摩根，你說說看，你讓我怎麼習慣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你瞧瞧，你說的這些，都說明維娜決定帶著我們一起來羅德島是對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要的羅德島都能給。不光是一張床，一點吃的。你呀，你總是對我說的這些沒興趣，但你心裡都是明白的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，我不需要知道敵人是誰，我只需要知道他們是敵人。我也能看清楚誰是真正的朋友，誰能真的幫到維娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒忘，我跟著她到這裡是為了什麼。我想看她拔劍。為了那一天，我因陀羅什麼都能做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......摩根，我最近好幾次夢見留下的那幫臭小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我懂了，你其實是在擔心那些傢伙吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰擔心她們！老子是那種瞎想的人嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真心話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關鍵就是，老子什麼都不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道她們過得怎麼樣，有沒有受傷，有沒有生病，有沒有......別人來找她們麻煩，尤其是那些傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我躺在這又軟又乾淨的床上，我就忍不住想，她們呢，她們現在怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你比任何人都瞭解她們。這麼多年了，我們熟悉彼此，如同熟悉自己的手足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你難道忘了，從小生活在倫蒂尼姆的我們，比誰都清楚如何在一次次爭鬥中活下來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是相信她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——就跟她們一直信我一樣。摩根，你也沒忘吧？她們每一個，還是小孩子的時候就跟在我們屁股後面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，當然記得。對了，那時候你也在我屁股後面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，能不能別打岔？就算我在你後面，也是你跑太快，老子是為了隨時踢你屁股。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎樣，那時候......我們發過誓。不說能不能有好日子，但至少不管什麼日子，每個人都有份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可現在......現在......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別唉聲歎氣的了。跟著維娜走這麼遠，難道你後悔了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因陀羅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才我說的作戰計畫，你都聽清楚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前半部分很明白，就是最後......維娜，你沒說我完事之後應該去哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一部分，我想讓你自己來選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以來這個位置，與我會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也可以去那個位置。到時候她們幾個會等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後你需要帶著她們迅速移動，之後該幹什麼幹什麼，不要再回到這裡來，也不要再找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜......你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我必須離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是外面那些傢伙？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏雲越來越近，你肯定也有所察覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，那群跟鼻涕一樣甩不脫的混球！來一個我打跑一個，來一群我打跑一群！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這已經不像打一架搶地盤那麼簡單。受傷的人正在變多。要不了多久，局勢就會超出我們目前的力量能掌控的範疇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不能坐以待斃，在這之前......我必須把主動權握在手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，摩根那傢伙也這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是——我跟她不一樣。我不想那麼多有的沒的。我只需要你告訴我，到這一天了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，這一天到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我留在這裡，你們每個人都有危險。你們都不想當懦夫，我也一樣。可是，我更厭惡無謂的犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，抗爭永遠不會停止，無論是在倫蒂尼姆，還是在外面。我們總有事情做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我會跟著你！你在哪裡，我就在哪裡，只要你需要我的拳頭一天，我就跟著你一天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因陀羅，你是我最信任的朋友。我享受和你並肩的每一場戰鬥。但今天，請你明白，我絕對不是在命令你跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我不確定自己什麼時候才能回到這裡。假如你決定跟著我，你也一樣。從此往後，我們每天都可能在不同的地方流浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後會面臨的一切，不用我說，你也能夠想像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "char_112_seige",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......你是我問的第一個人。畢竟在我加入格拉斯哥幫之前，你是她們的頭領。我想你或許會更願意為了她們而留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過了，這根本不是什麼需要想的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我認你當主子的那一天，我就已經決定好了之後的每一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要去的地方，就是我要去的地方。我的雙手，會為你掃除你的敵人，也會為你擁抱你的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天，要是你希望我留下來，我根本不會說一句話，我一定會為你留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可如果你問我——你就不需要問我第二次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的答案只有一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信你，維娜，你是我的王！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後悔......不可能。永遠都不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟著主子，就是我這輩子做的最正確的決定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀呀，你這突然嗓門這麼大，我看走廊另一頭的維娜都要給你吵醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你別亂說話，昨天晚上她又想事情想到那麼晚，現在肯定睡得正香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了行了，看你這麼有精神，我也不用陪你聊天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你接著用拳頭給牆開洞去吧。等有了洞，想跑就跑不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "char_154_morgan",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老子......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混球摩根，老子的字典裡就沒有逃跑兩個字！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島。我的王選擇了羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......憋在房間裡的話，還是看哪都不順眼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好煩，好煩啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，誰啊？肯定不是摩根，那笨蛋學不會敲門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是我，因陀羅幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被揍成那樣了居然還能站起來，你小子不錯嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是說這些傷嗎？哈哈，沒關係的啦，醫生姐姐們都幫我處理過了。過去爸爸帶我訓練，偶爾我也會把自己搞得鼻青臉腫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你不是來報仇的囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，報仇？沒有的事啊，這些傷是因陀羅幹員留下的，可是你不是在幫我訓練嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這小子，有點意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，因陀羅幹員是在誇獎我嗎？那我可不可以請你下次再陪我訓練？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還想挨揍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才在醫務室，我就在想，因陀羅幹員的拳法——呃，不說拳法啦，打架，說打架吧！因陀羅幹員打架真的好厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感受到了很多以前沒學過的東西，我想向你好好學習！拜託啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要向我學習？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你確定嗎？剛剛才被揍成那樣，你還敢找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被揍也是我自己實力不夠，怪不了因陀羅幹員啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，這裡的人，果然和外面的不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個拿鞭子的佩洛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，那是杜賓老師！她是我們的教官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫啥都無所謂！......嘖，你那是什麼表情，行了，我知道了，杜賓是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個杜賓，她說我要是準備好的話，還能回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就去試試看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑克",
      "speakerId": "char_347_jaksel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，因陀羅幹員答應我了？太棒啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，別高興得太早，老子動起手來不會客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......哼，切磋是吧，不就是控制分寸嘛，簡單得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "char_155_tiger",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指點你這樣的小傢伙而已，才難不倒老子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
